-- ============================================================================
-- FC8 EXPERT DEEP SEED: Metering, Control Valves & Storage, advanced tier.
--
-- Six modules, 26 lessons, 132 questions (15 per module bank plus a 42
-- question final exam). The structure row is GENERATED from the tier's
-- manifest.json rather than hand typed.
--
-- What this tier owns: THE TANK. One geometry and its three answers; the shell
-- by the one-foot method at two conditions, and the light product that makes
-- the water test govern; normal venting and the one predicate that says which
-- direction governs; the fire case, where the duty is computed and the vent is
-- WITHHELD BY NAME; evaporative losses and what control saves; and the whole
-- register of what these three engines do not carry.
--
-- THE ENGINE FACT THIS TIER OWNS. The engine refuses the emergency vent
-- capacity because the two plausible forms of the missing relation differ by a
-- factor of about 24, and it exports that refusal as a named constant.
--
-- WITHHELD, taught as a limit and never graded in any tier: the relation that
-- turns a fire duty into a required vent capacity. The capstone grades a shell
-- thickness, a crossover gravity, an inbreathing, a crossover draw rate, a
-- working capacity and a control saving, and states every thermal factor, the
-- allowable stresses, the minimum plate and a measured annual loss so that no
-- graded field rests on an engine default or on AP-42. The tier was audited
-- question by question against the digest and the engine before seeding
-- (AUDIT-advanced.md).
-- ============================================================================

